<title>SRI LANKA: CRICKET-SRI LANKA 2ND INNS 386-4 DECLARED V PAKISTAN.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-SRI LANKA 2ND INNS 386-4 DECLARED V PAKISTAN.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1997-04-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Sri Lanka declared their second innings at 386-4 shortly after tea on the fourth day of the second and final test on Tuesday, setting Pakistan 426 to win.</p>
<p>Scores: Sri Lanka 331 and 386-4 declared, Pakistan 292.</p>
